{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8cc0a99556bddcb5","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9014-E001\n3\ttitle: Llama Stack GA-readiness assessment\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9014\n5\tcomponent: Llama Stack\n6\tteam: RHOAI GenAI\n7\ttype: Investigation\n8\tpriority: P0\n9\tinvestigation_signals:\n10\t  question_specificity: 1\n11\t  source_accessibility: 1\n12\t  local_runnability: 0\n13\t  cluster_hardware_dependence: -1\n14\t  human_judgment_required: -1\n15\timplementation_type: null\n16\tdependencies: []\n17\tai_signals: null\n18\tai_implementability: Medium\n19\tai_implementability_score: 0\n20\tjira_key: null\n21\tbranch: null\n22\tgated_by: null\n23\tgate_failure_impact: null\n24\t---\n25\t# Llama Stack GA-Readiness Assessment\n26\t\n27\t## Description\n28\t\n29\tThis Investigation epic resolves the strategy's central unknown: the full\n30\tinventory of gaps between Llama Stack's current Tech Preview quality and the\n31\tGA bar. Tech Preview feedback is scattered across support tickets and no\n32\tsystematic GA-readiness assessment has been done. This epic performs that\n33\tassessment across the GA-bar dimensions — API stability, upgrade paths, scale\n34\tlimits, and error handling — and produces the definitive GA scope that all\n35\tdownstream GA work (API stability guarantee, production support posture, and\n36\tguardrails-integration hardening) is sized and confirmed against.\n37\t\n38\t## Scope\n39\t\n40\t- Consolidate Tech Preview feedback from support tickets and known issues\n41\t  into a single gap record.\n42\t- Assess each GA-bar dimension against the current Llama Stack distribution:\n43\t  - API stability of the published surface\n44\t  - Upgrade paths from prior Tech Preview releases\n45\t  - Scale limits\n46\t  - Error handling\n47\t- For each gap found, record current state, GA bar, severity, and a\n48\t  remediation estimate.\n49\t- Assess the TrustyAI guardrails integration against the GA bar and record\n50\t  any hardening needed beyond removing its experimental status.\n51\t- Publish the definitive GA scope document enumerating the work items\n52\t  required for GA graduation, for stakeholder acceptance.\n53\t\n54\t## Acceptance Criteria\n55\t\n56\t- A gap inventory exists covering all four GA-bar dimensions (API stability,\n57\t  upgrade paths, scale limits, error handling), each gap recorded with\n58\t  current state, GA bar, severity, and remediation estimate.\n59\t- Tech Preview feedback from support tickets is consolidated and reflected in\n60\t  the inventory.\n61\t- The guardrails-integration assessment outcome is recorded (additional\n62\t  hardening needed, or none beyond the supported-integration promotion).\n63\t- The definitive GA scope document is published and accepted by stakeholders,\n64\t  and each downstream GA work stream (API stability, support posture,\n65\t  guardrails integration) has its scope confirmed or adjusted against it.\n66\t\n67\t## HLR Traceability\n68\t\n69\t- **HLR-1 (P0)**: fully covered — this epic is the GA-readiness assessment\n70\t  that inventories the gaps between current TP quality and the GA bar and\n71\t  produces the definitive GA scope.\n72\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-83248e61379c6dd8","agent_id":"a60b08dd582e62c70","session_id":"44c1731f-e230-44d3-a6db-ee0916001d72","uuid":"4c37cf66-a201-4dc5-94ec-83ff118dd1e4","timestamp":"2026-10-26T13:17:08.579Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-8cc0a99556bddcb5","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9014 decomposition"}
