nagement is available with no opt-in action by the user or administrator.\n54\t- On a cluster without entitlement, Llama Stack management is not surfaced.\n55\t- No Tech Preview opt-in gate for Llama Stack management remains in the\n56\t  Dashboard configuration.\n57\t- The default-enablement behavior is covered by automated tests.\n58\t\n59\t## HLR Traceability\n60\t\n61\t- **HLR-5 (P1)**: fully covered — the Dashboard enables Llama Stack\n62\t  management by default for entitled clusters, with no TP opt-in gate.\n63\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-83248e61379c6dd8","agent_id":"a60b08dd582e62c70","session_id":"44c1731f-e230-44d3-a6db-ee0916001d72","uuid":"29353176-97a4-4d12-a20c-aa8c3bcbf41c","timestamp":"2026-10-26T13:17:11.518Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-a03b5fca18304676","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9014 decomposition"}
