mentation pointing at the supported TrustyAI\n56\t  integration.\n57\t- Dashboard availability notes reflecting default enablement on entitled\n58\t  clusters.\n59\t\n60\t## Acceptance Criteria\n61\t\n62\t- Llama Stack documentation meets GA documentation standards as defined by\n63\t  the Red Hat docs content process.\n64\t- Migration notes from Tech Preview exist and cover the tested upgrade path\n65\t  from the last two TP releases.\n66\t- The documentation is technically reviewed against the implemented behavior\n67\t  of the GA deliverables (API stability, support posture, guardrails\n68\t  integration, Dashboard availability) and discrepancies found in review are\n69\t  fixed.\n70\t- Documentation claims that reference the supported configuration matrix,\n71\t  SLO targets, and backport policy match the published support posture.\n72\t\n73\t## HLR Traceability\n74\t\n75\t- **HLR-6 (P2)**: fully covered — documentation uplifted to GA standards,\n76\t  including migration notes from Tech Preview.\n77\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-83248e61379c6dd8","agent_id":"a60b08dd582e62c70","session_id":"44c1731f-e230-44d3-a6db-ee0916001d72","uuid":"9173b516-5b29-4e46-aafd-81f9db81e32e","timestamp":"2026-10-26T13:17:12.290Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-89eda248ee4bf5e0","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9014 decomposition"}
